{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Serve The Cups",
    "steam_appid": 2688030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/1195db6034b1d5bb1e9d6312cb8bba82.avif?t=1753999822\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic coffee shop, absurd  machines, roguelite elements and run your dream coffee shop with your friends or alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new ways to make coffee through different coffee shops and gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, open a coffee shop from scratch, make coffees with fun mini-games and serve the cups to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can upgrade their machines and change their play style with points. Players can discover new coffee shops, new recipes, new seasons, new customers and new minigames. Learn new and fun ways to make coffee with Serve The Cups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/91009fae9649f5e25cd51251ed944900.poster.avif?t=1753999822\" width=618 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/91009fae9649f5e25cd51251ed944900.webm?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/91009fae9649f5e25cd51251ed944900.mp4?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make coffees with fun minigames and different styles. Brew, serve and upgrade your shop!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new coffee recipes while seasons changing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/017a23e85fac4f2d45ef237eb0603cd7.poster.avif?t=1753999822\" width=618 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/017a23e85fac4f2d45ef237eb0603cd7.webm?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/017a23e85fac4f2d45ef237eb0603cd7.mp4?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your coffee shop and check your stock. If life gives you coffee beans, you should brew them. If not, buy it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/c5b26c76b67731c491155da379dd63dd.poster.avif?t=1753999822\" width=618 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/c5b26c76b67731c491155da379dd63dd.webm?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/c5b26c76b67731c491155da379dd63dd.mp4?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the cups and make sure you keep your shop clean.\u00a0Customers don't prefer a dirty shop.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/1195db6034b1d5bb1e9d6312cb8bba82.avif?t=1753999822\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic coffee shop, absurd  machines, roguelite elements and run your dream coffee shop with your friends or alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new ways to make coffee through different coffee shops and gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, open a coffee shop from scratch, make coffees with fun mini-games and serve the cups to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can upgrade their machines and change their play style with points. Players can discover new coffee shops, new recipes, new seasons, new customers and new minigames. Learn new and fun ways to make coffee with Serve The Cups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/91009fae9649f5e25cd51251ed944900.poster.avif?t=1753999822\" width=618 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/91009fae9649f5e25cd51251ed944900.webm?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/91009fae9649f5e25cd51251ed944900.mp4?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make coffees with fun minigames and different styles. Brew, serve and upgrade your shop!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new coffee recipes while seasons changing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/017a23e85fac4f2d45ef237eb0603cd7.poster.avif?t=1753999822\" width=618 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/017a23e85fac4f2d45ef237eb0603cd7.webm?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/017a23e85fac4f2d45ef237eb0603cd7.mp4?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your coffee shop and check your stock. If life gives you coffee beans, you should brew them. If not, buy it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/c5b26c76b67731c491155da379dd63dd.poster.avif?t=1753999822\" width=618 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/c5b26c76b67731c491155da379dd63dd.webm?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688030/extras/c5b26c76b67731c491155da379dd63dd.mp4?t=1753999822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the cups and make sure you keep your shop clean.\u00a0Customers don't prefer a dirty shop.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Make the coffees and Serve the Cups! Get ready for a chaotic, roguelite coffee shop management experience up to 4 player. Manage your own coffee shop, brew lots of coffee, discover new ways to make coffee, try new maps, get permanent upgrades. With your friends or without them serve the cups!",
